+comment: Obsoleted as a vestige of over-formalization. This abstract 0D instantaneous boundary was never used within Uberon nor by taxon-specific developmental-stage ontologies. The colloquial concept of 'death' is better represented by 'death stage' (UBERON:0000071), treated analogously to 3D boundaries in Uberon as having some minimal extent. See https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3464
